      <div style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">2.&#160; <span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">Ratification of the appointment of Ernst &amp; Young LLP as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public
          accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2023:</span></div>

